WEBVTT

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:05.940
Man, I don't wanna go to school...

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.590
I do.

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:11.400
I wish we could time travel 
back to before summer break.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.400
Oh, you want to go back 
to before summer break?

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:16.910
You know you can't do that.

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:19.080
No...

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:23.660
Our time just went back to the 
first day of summer break!

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:26.630
No, it didn't. C'mon, let's go to school.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.670
Time travel with me, you guys...

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:38.530
Oh, well. Guess we should go to school.

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.440
<b>Episode 8</b>

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.440
<b>I Took Lunch Duty</b>

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:18.980
Okay, now you're all going 
to do some woodcraft.

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:22.490
There are some boards and a 
saw and hammer on your desks,

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:24.890
so make whatever you like.

00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:27.990
Sensei, question.

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:29.580
Yes, Natsumi-kun?

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:33.860
I think telling us to make "whatever 
we like" is too thoughtless.

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:35.680
When we're using things like saws,

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:39.050
I think it's dangerous to say 
irresponsible things like that.

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.540
Don't fall asleep! We need you!

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.730
How rude! I'm awake!

00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:53.180
I was just so surprised to hear 
you say something so sensible.

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:54.230
How rude!

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:58.990
I never thought I'd hear the word 
"irresponsible" come out of your mouth.

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:00.610
You, too, Nee-chan?

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:04.500
Well, I thought it'd be boring 
to just tell you what to make.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:07.450
I'll keep an eye on you, 
so you can feel safe building.

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:10.400
You still end up being irresponsible.

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:12.630
Let's make something together, Hotaru.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:14.040
O-Okay.

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:17.000
We'll put our desks together.

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:19.600
What should we make?

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:20.800
Hmm...

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:24.600
Maybe just nail the boards together 
to make a simple pen holder?

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:26.150
Oh, that sounds good.

00:03:26.150 --> 00:03:28.020
A wooden one would be kind of stylish.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:31.610
Aww, a pen holder? 
There's no creativity in that.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:34.100
Make something different.

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:36.400
Different? Like what?

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:38.030
Like...

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:40.590
A chopping board with no handle,

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:42.480
or a square tray,

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:43.860
or a hard cushion.

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:48.740
Those are all things you could 
finish without doing anything.

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:51.790
How about a book stand, then?

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.830
Oh, good idea! Let's do that!

00:03:57.060 --> 00:04:00.140
Ren-chon, you can team up 
with me to make something.

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:02.420
I'm on Nattsun's team!

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:05.180
Hmm, what should we make?

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:07.450
I'm okay with anything.

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:10.220
I wanna make something really cool.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:14.120
Something that'd make you say, 
"You can make this from wood?!"

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:16.450
What should we make?

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:17.310
A rock!

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:18.740
That's not possible.

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:21.830
Wh-Why'd you shoot it down right away?

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:23.520
Because it's wood.

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:25.200
It has to be something made from wood.

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:27.060
O-Oh, right.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:29.500
I thought a little too far outside the box.

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:33.060
Paper... How about paper?

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:35.210
Yeah, that's made from wood,

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.170
but we can't make it.

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:41.130
I can't come up with anything 
off the top of my head.

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:42.610
Aww...

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:46.890
It's times like this when I'm most 
curious to hear your ideas.

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:49.720
What you just said gave me an idea!

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.220
How about a mandarin?!

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:55.180
Those just grow on trees.

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:58.310
You take your inspiration 
from the weirdest places.

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:02.590
Hey, what're you guys doing?

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:05.850
We're drawing guide lines on the boards.

00:05:05.850 --> 00:05:09.830
We don't want it to be all rickety 
because the lengths are off.

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:13.930
Huh... Maybe I'll draw some plans, too.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:15.460
That sounds good.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:18.370
You get more ideas as you draw,

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:22.210
and they say moving the 
fingers exercises the mind.

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:27.360
Ren-chon, let's think up ideas 
by drawing plans in a notebook.

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:28.900
Plans?

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:31.100
I'll draw plans!

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:32.910
First, we'll draw a line,

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:36.880
and think about what to make 
as we move our fingers.

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:38.520
I'll think.

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:41.400
Then, when an idea comes together...

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.370
Let's see...

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.860
Mreeeawr

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.750
<b>Shyooom!</b>

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.750
Bam

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.750
Taste my Miracle
Rolling Headbutt!!

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.260
Counter!!

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.260
New
Year's
pine

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.260
Ramen

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.260
Stretching

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:13.860
Positive

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:13.860
Hot steam

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:13.860
Oops

00:06:13.860 --> 00:06:15.060
It is now
12:00 noon.

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:15.060
Sun

00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:15.060
Daidarabotchi

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:19.230
Not like this!

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:20.950
What's wrong, Nattsun?

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:22.760
Why'd you play along and then get mad?

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:24.780
We're drawing plans!

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.900
What are we supposed to 
plan from that stuff?!

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:29.250
Now we just put it together.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:30.760
Want to start nailing, then?

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:33.620
Whoa, they're already that far along?

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:37.640
No, wait. This is when I need to calm down,

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:39.580
or I won't get any good ideas.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.710
Idea... Idea...

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:51.090
Ren-chon, you know the doorknob 
on your bathroom door?

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.550
That thing...

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:56.010
...just looks like a duck to me.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:01.190
And? Do you have an idea?

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:02.770
Nope!

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:04.280
It's no use!

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:07.570
The more I think, 
the less I can come up with!

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.690
I need a more original idea...

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:16.200
Nattsun, did you really think 
I had no ideas at all?

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:19.690
I was just pretending I didn't before.

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:22.080
Just playing around a little.

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:26.100
I love thinking up cutting-edge 
ideas like that!

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:26.920
Ren-chon?!

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.960
If that's the case, just leave it to me!

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:32.850
To me, the handle part of the jack knife!

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:34.720
Wow! You've got such a good grip!

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:39.060
Or I'd also be happy if you'd call 
me a walking dictionary that walks!

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:41.230
A "walking dictionary" <i>does</i> walk!

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:44.190
First, I'll draw guide lines.

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:46.380
What should I do?

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:49.870
You can cut along the lines with the saw.

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:51.100
Yes, sir!

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.410
What should I do after it's cut?

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:57.120
Hammer the nails in place in 
the order that I tell you to!

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:01.120
First, put that board down as a base, 
then stand the big one up on it!

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.410
L-Like this?

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:03.830
More to the center!

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:04.980
Here?

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:06.710
More to the right!

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:11.240
Th-This is what you came up with?

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:16.140
What is this?!

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.310
I must say, it came out very well.

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.390
Ren-chon, what do you use this for?

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:24.400
Okay, I'll try using it right now.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.630
Don't fall asleep!

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:51.340
We need you!

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:09.160
Oh, so this is what you ended up making?

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:10.660
Yeah. It's a book stand.

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:13.810
That smell...

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:15.780
We're having curry today?

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:16.570
Looks like it.

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:19.030
I'll serve it up!

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:21.200
Curry for lunch and Renge...

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.770
That pairing...

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:25.050
Renge probably doesn't remember it, though.

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:29.040
I never thought such a gruesome 
incident would happen at this school.

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.000
What happened?

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:33.230
You wanna know?

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:34.470
Well...

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:40.470
<i>Recess! Recess!</i>

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:42.930
<i>I'm gonna play with blocks!</i>

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:45.390
<i>Shokichi-san...</i>

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:47.360
<i>Hey, Komari-chan.</i>

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:50.450
<i>You're not supposed to 
bring dolls to school.</i>

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:53.430
<i>Huh? Shokichi-san is okay.</i>

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:55.400
<i>I put him away during class.</i>

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:58.450
<i>The teacher's gonna take it 
if she catches you with it.</i>

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:02.460
<i>She said I could bring him as long as 
I don't play with him during class!</i>

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:03.810
<i>Huh...</i>

00:10:04.230 --> 00:10:06.910
<i>By the way, did Hikage stay home today?</i>

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:08.300
<i>I don't know.</i>

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:10.710
<i>Maybe she's sick?</i>

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:13.420
<i>Even though she was 
perfectly fine yesterday?</i>

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:16.850
<i>Oh, we're having curry 
for lunch today, though,</i>

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:18.680
<i>so I guess we can eat Hikage's share.</i>

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:22.690
<i>Hey! Show a little concern for Hikage-chan!</i>

00:10:19.270 --> 00:10:20.870
<i>What're you doing?</i>

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:25.600
<i>Okay, no seconds for you, then.</i>

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.810
<i>No way! I want extra curry, too!</i>

00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:31.310
<i>Hey.</i>

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:33.730
<i>Oh, speak of the devil.</i>

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:35.900
<i>Pretty lax about when you 
come to school, aren't you?</i>

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:39.780
<i>Well, things got a little 
crazy, so I ran late.</i>

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:41.630
<i>Hika-nee, you're tardy?</i>

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:43.340
<i>What's the problem? It's fine.</i>

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:46.200
<i>Is not! Is not!</i>

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.670
<i>I'm gonna tell the teacher!</i>

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:49.640
<i>Are you a kid?</i>

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:50.770
<i>Yes, she is.</i>

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:55.880
<i>Hika-nee, there's something behind you!</i>

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:01.670
<i>Hikage-chan, you can't bring that to school!</i>

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:03.930
<i>The teacher's gonna take it 
if she catches you with it.</i>

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:06.100
<i>Whoa, it's moving!</i>

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.810
<i>Just what do you people 
think my baby sister is?</i>

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:11.940
<i>My mom came down with a fever 
and went to the hospital,</i>

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:14.820
<i>so she said to have someone 
at school watch her.</i>

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:17.290
<i>Oh, so that's why you were late.</i>

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:19.980
<i>You could've just stayed at home.</i>

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:22.430
<i>Today's lunch is curry, so I can't miss.</i>

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:24.200
<i>Darn, you remembered...</i>

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:26.440
<i>So here you go, Candy Store.</i>

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:27.650
<i>Huh?</i>

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:33.110
<i>The teacher said you should look 
after Renge since you're the oldest.</i>

00:11:33.110 --> 00:11:35.400
<i>Huh?! Why me?</i>

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:37.780
<i>Konomi would be better 
at this stuff than me!</i>

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:40.380
<i>Say whatever you want, 
but what's decided is decided.</i>

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.220
<i>She's all yours, oldest.</i>

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:44.220
<i>Hey, Konomi!</i>

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:48.370
<i>Okay, Nacchan and Komari-chan, let's play.</i>

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:50.040
<i>You, too, Glasses-kun.</i>

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:51.890
<i>Hey! Don't run away!</i>

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:53.790
<i>So there you have it.</i>

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:55.820
<i>Here, try and hold her.</i>

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:57.860
<i>Er, hold her?</i>

00:11:57.860 --> 00:12:00.960
<i>I'm not really good with 
kids. You sure it's okay?</i>

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:02.770
<i>It's fine, it's fine.</i>

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:11.370
<i>Augh! She bit me!</i>

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.750
<i>Oh, Renge bites things she's interested in.</i>

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.710
<i>Isn't that great? She likes you.</i>

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:18.420
<i>It is not great!</i>

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:20.880
<i>It's all wet... I'm gonna go wash this.</i>

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:22.830
<i>Hey, hang on!</i>

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:25.240
<i>I have to wash the pacifier 
Renge dropped, too!</i>

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:26.900
<i>Wait!</i>

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:31.100
<i>Okay!</i>

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:35.330
<i>Today's the day I'm gonna build 
the tallest block tower ever!</i>

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:37.790
<i>Go for it, Nacchan!</i>

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:47.240
<i>Huh?</i>

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:51.700
<i>Where'd those two go? 
They left the baby by herself.</i>

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:55.210
<i>Hey, she can walk already?</i>

00:12:55.530 --> 00:12:58.200
<i>C'mon, come this way.</i>

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:03.920
<i>She really came! How cute...</i>

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.220
<i>And Natsumi-chan sets a new all-time rec—</i>

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:20.070
<i>My all-time record...</i>

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:23.990
<i>My all-time record!</i>

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:26.930
<i>I only needed one more block!</i>

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:28.500
<i>What the heck?!</i>

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:30.600
<i>Natsumi, don't cry over something like that.</i>

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:34.000
<i>You can have half my candy 
when we get home, okay?</i>

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:34.810
<i>Really?</i>

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:37.610
<i>Wow, you're such a good big sister.</i>

00:13:37.610 --> 00:13:39.250
<i>Nice job, Komari-chan.</i>

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:42.990
<i>Well, I'm in third grade now.</i>

00:13:42.990 --> 00:13:44.720
<i>It's only natural...</i>

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:55.090
<i>Shokichi-san! Shokichi-san!</i>

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:57.040
<i>Look at Shokichi-san!</i>

00:13:57.040 --> 00:13:59.290
<i>Shokichi-san's all wet!</i>

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:01.800
<i>Hey, Komari-chan, calm down.</i>

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:03.330
<i>Come on, calm down.</i>

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:05.310
<i>What's all this? What happened?</i>

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:07.740
<i>Well, a few things...</i>

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:09.940
<i>Renge-chan was... Wait, huh?</i>

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:12.800
<i>She was just here! 
Did she take off somewhere?</i>

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:13.520
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:15.620
<i>Did she go out in the hallway?!</i>

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:18.040
<i>I didn't see her in the hallway...</i>

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:19.970
<i>Oh! There she is!</i>

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:21.540
<i>That's the pantry!</i>

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:23.770
<i>Jeez, what a little...</i>

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:25.420
<i>Ren—</i>

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:26.620
<i>What are you—</i>

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:29.800
<i>Are you trying to make curry 
the main dish today?!</i>

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:30.960
<i>What's up?</i>

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:34.010
<i>Renge's taking the curry hostage! 
She's curry-napping!</i>

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:35.060
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:37.020
<i>Whoa! Careful!</i>

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.360
<i>Renge, stop! Stop!</i>

00:14:57.240 --> 00:14:59.290
<i>Nummy, nummy!</i>

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:01.970
<i>Our curry...</i>

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:05.070
<i>I was really looking forward to it, too...</i>

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:07.630
<i>Curry...</i>

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:10.160
<i>Curry! Curry! Curry!</i>

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:14.110
<i>The curry we were looking 
forward to all day!</i>

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:17.770
<i>Nummy, nummy!</i>

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:20.730
<i>Curry! Curry!</i>

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.220
<i>Nummy!</i>

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:29.940
And that's how Ren-chon conquered the 
school on her very first day here.

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:31.070
Wow!

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:33.530
I'll never forget that moment.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:46.180
Here you go.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.630
My relatives sent them.

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:50.340
Oh, thanks.

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:51.970
What's that?

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:54.430
A falling-asleep prevention device.

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:55.290
Huh?

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:56.970
Renge made it, apparently.

00:15:57.660 --> 00:16:00.730
How do you use it? Try it out.

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:21.990
That's probably clean enough.

00:16:22.260 --> 00:16:23.040
Oh...

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:25.540
Gotta put the books back.

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:28.960
Ow! I stepped on something!

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:33.430
Jeez... What was that? A super ball?

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:36.190
Yep, it's a super ball.

00:16:36.190 --> 00:16:38.140
Hm? There's something behind it.

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:46.170
It's Shokichi-san.

00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:49.530
I think he's even more torn-up than before.

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:52.270
I guess maybe I don't need him anymore...

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:54.560
Nee-chan!

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:57.920
Will you help me look for my super ball?

00:16:57.920 --> 00:16:59.950
Careful. It hurts like 
crazy if you step on it.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.410
Too late.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:03.240
What's with that face?

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:06.130
That's the face you make after 
getting your height measured.

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:08.640
I stepped on your super ball!

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:11.170
Don't play with your stuff in my room!

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:13.360
Oh, that's where it was?

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:15.550
Hand it over. It's my treasure.

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:19.100
If it's your treasure, 
why'd you throw it into my room?

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:21.090
I didn't!

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:26.580
I found the super ball I loved as a kid, 
so I was throwing it around to play with it.

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:27.900
You did throw it, then.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.090
Well, it turned up, so whatever.

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.610
I'm gonna go play outside.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:33.860
Fine, fine.

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:36.570
Let's see... What else was I going to do?

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:39.620
Oh, right. Put away the books.

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:43.230
Huh? An album?

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:45.030
When's this from?

00:17:48.930 --> 00:17:51.410
This is from a pretty long time ago.

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:55.130
Hey, I wonder how I got that cut on my face.

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:04.640
Oh, yeah. I remember.

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:09.400
I tried to get Shokichi-san when he 
fell onto the eaves, and I slipped.

00:18:44.550 --> 00:18:46.300
It's so hot...

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:51.730
Coming!

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:54.840
Oh, hi, Senpai.

00:18:54.840 --> 00:18:57.550
Sorry I didn't call first.

00:18:57.550 --> 00:18:58.920
Are you free?

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:02.420
Sure. It's hot out, so come on inside.

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:04.200
Thanks.

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:05.580
Hey, Hotaru...

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.300
Yes? What is it?

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:11.130
You made a bunch of plushies of me, right?

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.400
What's wrong?

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:16.130
There's nothing there to trip over.

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:18.390
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:21.910
Was it wrong of me to make 
those without asking you?!

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:24.760
Huh? Not at all. They were really good.

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:30.410
Actually, this plushie I loved when 
I was little got kinda torn up...

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:33.310
I was hoping you could 
show me how to fix him.

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:36.780
A-All my sewing tools are in my room...

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:39.440
Can we go to your room, then?

00:19:39.880 --> 00:19:42.900
I brought some sewing tools, too.

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:44.490
Huh? My room?

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:45.350
Yeah.

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:48.290
U-Uh, Senpai...

00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:57.500
Wow, you made all these...

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:00.420
You really like plushies a lot, huh?

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:02.600
I guess you are like an elementary 
schooler, in that way.

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:03.930
Y-Yeah...

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:07.750
But instead of making just plushies of me,

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:10.110
why don't you make some 
of other people, too?

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:12.810
Isn't it boring to have 
the same ones every day?

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:15.610
Huh? I don't think it's boring...

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:18.280
But, uh, I'll do that.

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:22.360
So, as for this... How do 
you think I can fix it?

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:26.100
Well... It's pretty worn out...

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:30.200
It might be best to remake 
it from new cloth.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:34.620
It seems like that would make it a 
totally different plushie, though.

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:36.300
We'll have to patch it, then.

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:44.570
What do I do next?

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:47.300
Well, right there...

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:50.150
Oh, that looks good.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:52.830
You're so fast at making these.

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:54.230
Y-You think so?

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:57.150
Ouch!

00:20:56.130 --> 00:20:58.110
Are you okay?!

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:05.480
Bye, Hotaru. Let's play 
at my house next time.

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:08.230
Okay! Take care!

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:41.680
Nee-chan, dinner's ready, 
so Mom said to set the table.

00:21:41.680 --> 00:21:42.820
Okay.

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:46.560
Hey, what happened to that super ball?

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:49.970
I put it back in the toy box in my closet.

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:53.510
Make sure you don't lose it.

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:55.630
It'll be too late to regret it once you do.

00:21:55.630 --> 00:21:59.040
Huh? Why are you trying 
to sound like a grown-up?

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:00.990
'Cause I am a grown-up.

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:16.460
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:21.550
<b>That's all for today</b>

00:23:41.300 --> 00:23:44.060
<i>Mayday? Is this mayday?!</i>

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:45.360
<i>Enough of that!</i>

00:23:46.240 --> 00:23:47.990
<i>Nacchan, stop.</i>

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.490
<b>Episode 9</b>

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.490
<b>We Looked at the Moon Together</b>

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
<b>Non Non Biyori
Repeat</b>

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
Photo: Tsukune

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
Please Watch Again
